                        


Item#: 5509 

Containment class:  Safe

Special Containment Procedures:  Scp-5509 doesn't need a special containment since this scp is always calm about his captivity and never attempted any form of escape.

Description:  Despite his appearance scp-5509 is calm and only want to know his origins, scp-5509 have some sort of amnesia, don't remembering anything from his past, just some images and sensations, 5509 is always confused when he sees any animals giving him a headache, also before the first encounter he doesn't know anything about humans despite knowing elements made by humans.

Scp-5509 is a tall humanoid creature with many forms of “scars” in his body, we don't know for sure if are really scars or is part of the normal body of 5509, his feet ended in a conical form and it seems that doesn't affect at all his movement, his eyes are big occupying a large portion of the front of the face and also this applies for his mouth, 5509 always have problem closing his mouth consequently giving him a semi-permanent smile, the color of the skin of 5509 is a muddy swampy green, this color is natural on this scp, 5509 have a special ability that is he can concentrate enough heat in his hands to burn something but 5509 say that he doesn't like to use that, when we asked why he doesn't like to use the ability he says “I don't know, just I feel weird when I use it”.

DNA test have shown that 5509 doesn't have human DNA, he has a strange version of DNA of reptiles and unknown DNA.

First encounter with scp-5509:  One day in Chile many citizens of a city report have been seeing a tall creature roaming around the city, the citizens freak out when they see scp-5509, despite this there's any report that say that 5509 harm someone, this alarm the foundation who send personnel to capture and bring scp-5509 to the foundation, when they encounter him 5509 doesn't put any form of resistance and it looked confused and tired, once 5509 was in the foundation he offers the foundation to investigate him saying “I see that you guys are some sort of research facility, you guys can do any form of research on me except if the research include harming me, I don't know anything of me either, I'm confused about myself” after this many doctors have been doing research in scp-5509 but no one has determined the origin of scp-5509.

Here's the most important interview realized to scp-5509.



Dr. Santdiego here, the foundation have assigning me the task to interview scp-5509 the documents I have read about this scp tell me that scp-5509 is friendly to others, and he never harms someone, the only thing he wants is know his origins and who is him.

When I enter his room he was waiting patiently in a chair and a table there was another chair, I sit in the chair, and he began to speak.

Hello doctor
Santdiego.
Oh Santdiego, good name, they told me that I have an interview today with you, so here you are, you can begin asking yours questions I will answer them all.
First question, do you have any names or some way to refer to you.
Umhh (He was silent for a while) now that you tell I remember one, I think my name was “Encantador”, aside that I don't remember any other except the number the foundation gave me.
So do you want to be called “Encantador”?
If you want.
So “Encantador” before you were capture by the foundation, What you remember?
I remember waking up in a strange place, don't knowing who I am or what was me, but somehow I can speak perfectly and have basic knowledge, next I began roaming around and then I see humans, that was my first time seeing humans and knowing about their existence, I go closer to them to ask any sort of help, but they ran away.
So are you telling me that you don't know until that moment about humans?
Yes, but at that moment I already know about the other things in the world and humans was the only thing “new” to me.
That's interesting, tell me, do you remember animals?
Yes I remember animals but I feel weird looking at them, like that they're not how I remember the animals.
Do you have any memories before you wake up in the place.
Yes I remember a laboratory, a female silhouette, a name, I don't remember the name and a lot of crystal panels.
Do you think you have another type of body in the time before the wake-up?
No, this body I feel that always I have it.
Hmmm That's for today, thanks for letting me to do this interview, the information you gave me may be crucial to know yours origins.
Thank you doctor.


End of the interview.
